---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | IT365.kr"
  description="Privacy Policy, Cookie Usage, and Google AdSense disclosure for IT365.kr."
  lang="en"
  canonicalUrl="https://it365.kr/en/privacy/"
  koAlternateUrl="https://it365.kr/ko/privacy/"
  enAlternateUrl="https://it365.kr/en/privacy/"
  koSwitchUrl="/ko/privacy/"
  enSwitchUrl="/en/privacy/"
>
  <article class="article-container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Effective Date: October 30, 2026</p>
    <p>
      At <strong>IT365.kr</strong>, we respect the privacy of our visitors and comply with applicable data protection regulations and Google Publisher Policies.
    </p>
    <h2>1. Log Files & Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      IT365.kr follows a standard procedure of using log files and cookies to store visitor preferences (such as theme and language settings) and analyze traffic performance.
    </p>
    <h2>2. Google AdSense & DART Cookie Disclosure</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites.</li>
      <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
